    "answer": "For a SOC or security-engineering position, I would probably choose either one of my multi-source incident investigations or the NOC security-engineering project.\n\nThe reason is that those projects require more than knowing a product interface. They require me to take incomplete evidence, determine what is significant, correlate multiple sources, build a hypothesis, test it, determine scope, and decide what action is justified.\n\nThat investigation process is what I want an employer to evaluate.",
