    "topic": "Portfolio Conversation",
    "question": "You mention firewalls. What is your approach to firewall security?",
    "answer": "I prefer explicit, explainable controls.\n\nI want to understand the business or technical reason that traffic is allowed before creating the rule. I consider source, destination, service, direction, zone, application where applicable, logging requirements, and the security effect of the rule.\n\nI also think about rule order and unintended access paths.\n\nAfter implementation, I would validate both sides: traffic that should pass must still work, and traffic that should be denied must actually be denied.",
