    "topic": "Portfolio Conversation",
    "question": "How do you prioritize multiple alerts?",
    "answer": "I do not prioritize only by whatever severity the product assigned.\n\nI consider detection confidence, asset criticality, user privilege, external exposure, behavior observed, potential blast radius, and whether there is evidence of active compromise.\n\nA medium-severity alert involving a domain administrator or critical server could require faster attention than a high-severity alert on an isolated low-value endpoint.\n\nI want the priority to represent actual organizational risk.",
