    "answer": "I designed the portfolio around my own learning, labs, investigations, configurations, and technical documentation, but I also use modern tools, including AI, to accelerate research, organization, documentation, and development.\n\nI do not think using AI removes the need to understand the work. I still need to determine whether a configuration makes sense, whether detection logic is valid, whether the investigation conclusion is supported by evidence, and where the limitations are.\n\nThat is also why I distinguish between static validation, synthetic testing, lab testing, and production experience instead of presenting all of those as the same thing.",
