    "topic": "Portfolio Conversation",
    "question": "Do you consider yourself more SOC, network security, or engineering?",
    "answer": "My strongest foundation is security operations and investigation, but I have intentionally expanded into detection engineering, endpoint security, networking, and security engineering.\n\nI do not see those areas as competing with one another.\n\nUnderstanding networks makes me a stronger SOC analyst. Understanding detection engineering makes me better at identifying why alerts exist and how they should be improved. Understanding endpoint behavior makes incident response stronger.\n\nUltimately, I want to be the analyst or engineer who can follow an incident across those boundaries.",
